       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. QTT13K.
      * BENEFICIARY INTEREST RULE (TRUSTS)
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-RULE-PCT               PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 15.00.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  LK-INTEREST               PIC 9(3)V99.
       01  LK-IDENTIFY               PIC X(1).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-INTEREST LK-IDENTIFY.
       1000-RULE.
           MOVE 'N' TO LK-IDENTIFY
           IF LK-INTEREST NOT < WS-RULE-PCT
              MOVE 'Y' TO LK-IDENTIFY
           END-IF
           GOBACK.
